#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/advanced-features.md:76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"![Screenshot shows mentioning a colleague](/screenshots/cypress/usage-"
"advanced-features.cy.js/ticket-article-mention.png)"
