"![Снимак екрана приказује функцију помињања](/screenshots/cypress/usage-"
"advanced-features.cy.js/ticket-article-mention.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/advanced-features.md:81
msgid ""
"Ask or request information from your colleagues or mention them in important "
"tickets so they receive notifications for ticket updates and are "
"automatically subscribed to this ticket."
