msgid ""
"This was a brief introduction about how to work with Zammad if you are "
"completely new to ticket systems. Knowing the basics of Zammad now, you can "
"either start working or have a look at the [advanced features section]"
"(advanced-features)  to become even more productive and use the full "
"potential of Zammad. 🚀"
msgstr ""

