#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:159
msgid ""
"The recommended method is to use [Elastic's official guide](https://"
"www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/install-"
"elasticsearch.html){target=_blank} for installing Elasticsearch."
