"elasticsearch.html){target=_blank} за инсталацију Elasticsearch."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:162
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can follow [our example setup](/en/tutorials/install-"
"elasticsearch.md) of Elasticsearch 7, which we included in another page to "
