#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "File-Attachment Indexing Rules"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch.md:85
msgid ""
"Zammad supports searching in file attachments, which means Elasticsearch has "
"to index those, too. Limiting such indexing can help preserve system "
"resources."
